; Minimal nested-pattern rewrite test. Rule body matches `(A (A x))` —
; two instances of the unary constructor `A` stacked, with `x` ranging
; over any Math term. Exercises a self-join on the view relation with
; a shared e-class variable, plus rule-derived unions with more than one
; body atom.
;
; Cross-check: `egglog a_involution.egg` must exit 0.
; Ported to ascent_tests_dd/src/egglog_port.rs::a_involution_nested_pattern.

(sort Math)
(constructor Leaf () Math)
(constructor A (Math) Math)

(rewrite (A (A x)) x)

(A (A (Leaf)))

(run 1)

(check (= (A (A (Leaf))) (Leaf)))
